Honesty register:
This software wraps CSOAI's live /api/assess endpoint. The signed passports
it issues are ASSURANCE ATTESTATIONS of declared posture, not legal
certifications. EU AI Act Article 50 compliance requires competent
authority evaluation (not yet constituted as of 2026-07-08); this tool
helps with the verifiable receipt layer, not with the legal determination.

We sign evidence. We do not certify intent.
